1
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,600
This is Tely, running live on Azure.

2
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:57,400
Here's how. Our Director agent, on Microsoft Agent Framework, hears ten seconds ahead, so the voice builds before the chance, but it returns only a tension plan, never the result.

3
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:04,600
It runs on GPT-5 mini in Microsoft Foundry, and every run is traced in Application Insights.

4
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:12,300
A Verifier checks every line in code: seventy lines, zero spoiler leaks, every number verified.

5
00:01:12,550 --> 00:01:16,750
Thirty-one live questions, all answered, the first words in about a second.

6
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,000
And fans can ask out loud, through Foundry Voice Live.

7
00:01:34,650 --> 00:01:39,450
It all runs on a Container Apps relay with a managed identity: no keys.

8
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:44,800
Azure Speech HD in seven languages, and accessibility tests on every push.
